STYLE: flat 2D cartoon characters with bold black outlines and a slight brush
taper, flat cel-shaded fills with no gradient and no texture on the
characters, placed inside a photorealistic 3D-rendered stone age world —
real rock, real dirt, real firelight, real fur and real wood, all rendered
realistically. The characters stay completely flat and cartoon inside it.
PALETTE: earth tones — grey stone, brown dirt, dry grass, with warm orange
firelight as the single accent. Vertical 9:16.
NEGATIVE: no modern objects, no metal, no fabric other than fur, no realistic
shading on the characters, no 3D render on the characters, no fingers, no
camera shake, no whip pans, no spinning, no watermark, no on-screen text, no
captions, no subtitles.
